{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43492","headline":"郊坛听雅乐 · 无名氏","name":"郊坛听雅乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泰坛恭祀事，彩仗下寒垧。\n展礼陈嘉乐，斋心动衆灵。\n韵长飘更远，曲度静宜听。\n泛响何清越，随风散杳冥。\n彻悬和气聚，旋退晓山青。\n本自钧天降，还疑列洞庭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43492.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43492","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}